+// RRS format: <insn> R1,R2,M3,D4(B4)
+//    +--------+----+----+----+-------------+----+---+--------+
+//    | OpCode | R1 | R2 | B4 |     D4      | M3 |///| OpCode |
+//    +--------+----+----+----+-------------+----+---+--------+
+//    0        8    12   16   20            32   36   40      47
